\newlabel{tab:repair}{{2}{8}{Recall at 32K after repair. Suite columns use 100 cases per cell and RULER columns 50; repaired values are means over three seeds. At 2B the control is the source model trained with the same recipe (mean over two seeds); at 8B the source was not retrained. MV is a lower bound under the 64-token generation limit, loose at 2B (Section~\ref {sec:ruler}). Parcels is the held-out fact template}{table.2}{}}
